From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 15:31:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] clk: sunxi-ng: a733: Relock PLL_GPU0 after a rate change

The lock detector of PLL_GPU0 is switched on once at probe and stays
on. A rate change writes the new factors and polls the lock bit without
restarting the detector. The manual's sequence for a factor change
restarts it after the write and waits for the lock again.

Register the common PLL notifier for PLL_GPU0 with LOCK_ENABLE as its
toggle bit, as the H616 does for its GPU PLL. It clears and sets the
bit after every rate change and waits for the lock.

Not covered: the other PLLs of this unit take the same generic path.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: on two boards the GPU's probe changed the
rate of PLL_GPU0 while its output was gated, the PLL relocked, and the
GPU firmware booted, also after reloading the GPU driver.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c | 13 ++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
index 8f94408b29a1..7002df3a8e23 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun60i-a733.c
@@ -2394,6 +2394,16 @@ static const struct sunxi_ccu_desc sun60i_a733_ccu_desc = {
 	.num_resets	= ARRAY_SIZE(sun60i_a733_ccu_resets),
 };
 
+/*
+ * After a factor change the manual restarts the lock detector of the PLL
+ * and waits for the lock again (4.1.4.1).
+ */
+static struct ccu_pll_nb sun60i_a733_pll_gpu0_nb = {
+	.common		= &pll_gpu0_clk.common,
+	.enable		= BIT(29),	/* LOCK_ENABLE */
+	.lock		= BIT(28),
+};
+
 static const u32 pll_regs[] = {
 	SUN60I_A733_PLL_REF_REG,
 	SUN60I_A733_PLL_DDR_REG,
@@ -2456,7 +2466,8 @@ static int sun60i_a733_ccu_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
-	return 0;
+	/* Re-lock PLL_GPU0 after any rate change */
+	return ccu_pll_notifier_register(&sun60i_a733_pll_gpu0_nb);
 }
 
 static const struct of_device_id sun60i_a733_ccu_ids[] = {
